| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Projection: Float64(100) * sum(CASE WHEN snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_TYPE LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT ELSE Int64(0) END) / sum(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT) AS promo_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |   Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[sum(CASE WHEN snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_TYPE LIKE Utf8("PROMO%") THEN snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT) ELSE Int64(0) END), sum(snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (Int64(1) - snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_DISCOUNT))]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_PARTKEY = snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART.P_PARTKEY                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM projection=[L_PARTKEY, L_EXTENDEDPRICE, L_DISCOUNT], full_filters=[snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SHIPDATE >= CAST(Utf8("1995-09-01") AS Date32), snowflake.TPCH_SF1.LINEITEM.L_SHIPDATE < CAST(Utf8("1995-10-01") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |       TableScan: snowflake.TPCH_SF1.PART projection=[P_PARTKEY, P_TYPE]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=snowflake compute_context=username=SGREBNOV,account=MAAGZJQ-BIB84773,warehouse=COMPUTE_WH,role=accountadmin base_sql=SELECT ((100.0 * sum(CASE WHEN "PART"."P_TYPE" LIKE 'PROMO%' THEN ("LINEITEM"."L_EXTENDEDPRICE" * (1 - "LINEITEM"."L_DISCOUNT")) ELSE 0 END)) / sum(("LINEITEM"."L_EXTENDEDPRICE" * (1 - "LINEITEM"."L_DISCOUNT")))) AS "promo_revenue" FROM "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."LINEITEM" INNER JOIN "BENCHMARKS"."TPCH_SF1"."PART" ON (("LINEITEM"."L_PARTKEY" = "PART"."P_PARTKEY") AND (("LINEITEM"."L_SHIPDATE" >= CAST('1995-09-01' AS DATE)) AND ("LINEITEM"."L_SHIPDATE" < CAST('1995-10-01' AS DATE)))) |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
